{"name":"Four folding doors in a 1610 x 2270 opening, Tuen (design)","source":"Built in Trimble SketchUp through the connector (12 Oct 2026) for design request design-2026-10-door-tuen-dkn5. Measured: the opening 1610 wide x 2270 high through a 140 mm wall. Standard: 18 mm lining, four folding doors in two pairs (about 390 x 2210, 35 thick, frame with a mid rail and two panels, as the doors in the photos), hung from a top track, 70 x 22 architrave both sides, skirting and picture rail on both sides as room context. Units mm, X along the wall, Y through it (the room is -Y), Z up. Updated 13 Oct 2026 (change of 12 Oct: the end door of each pair on parliament hinges): the track and doors moved forward to the room face of the lining (doors 0 to 35 mm in from the room side), the end doors pivot 12 mm in front of the face and swing 180 so each folded pair lies almost flat on the wall, clear of the architrave and skirting.","materials":{"Wall":{"color":[236,233,226],"roughness":0.95},"Room: oak floor":{"color":[176,124,76],"roughness":0.7},"Room: white woodwork":{"color":[242,240,234],"roughness":0.8},"Lining, softwood":[214,180,132],"Architrave, MDF":[200,172,142],"Track, aluminium":{"color":[176,180,186],"roughness":0.4,"metalness":0.6},"Pine door":[226,186,134],"Knob, brass":{"color":[176,140,70],"roughness":0.35,"metalness":0.7}},"moves":{"Door 1: Frame":{"hinge":{"origin":[21,-12,0],"axis":[0,0,-1],"angle":180},"at":[0.3,1],"with":["Door 1: Panel, bottom","Door 1: Panel, top","Door 2: Frame"]},"Door 2: Frame":{"hinge":{"origin":[412.25,35,0],"axis":[0,0,1],"angle":177},"at":[0,0.5],"with":["Door 2: Panel, bottom","Door 2: Panel, top","Door 2: Knob"]},"Door 4: Frame":{"hinge":{"origin":[1589,-12,0],"axis":[0,0,1],"angle":180},"at":[0.3,1],"with":["Door 4: Panel, bottom","Door 4: Panel, top","Door 3: Frame"]},"Door 3: Frame":{"hinge":{"origin":[1197.75,35,0],"axis":[0,0,-1],"angle":177},"at":[0,0.5],"with":["Door 3: Panel, bottom","Door 3: Panel, top","Door 3: Knob"]}},